{"path":"utility/variant/index","title":"std::variant<Types...>::index","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::variant&lt;Types...&gt;::</span>index","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/variant/index","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the zero-based index of the alternative that is currently held by the variant.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> index<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the zero-based index of the alternative that is currently held by the variant.\n</p><p>If the variant is <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/valueless_by_exception\"><code>valueless_by_exception</code></a>, returns <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/variant_npos\"><code>variant_npos</code></a>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;variant&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant\"><span class=\"kw1093\">std::<span class=\"me2\">variant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> v <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"abc\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"v.index = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> v.<span class=\"me1\">index</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    v <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"v.index = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> v.<span class=\"me1\">index</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>v.index = 1\nv.index = 0</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/holds_alternative\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>holds_alternative</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks if a <code>variant</code> currently holds a given type <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variant/get\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>get<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::variant)</span></span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  reads the value of the variant given the index or the type (if the type is unique), throws on error <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/variant","title":"std::variant"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::variant<Types...>::index","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++17. Returns the zero-based index of the alternative that is currently held by the variant."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"holds_alternative","note":"checks if a variant currently holds a given type"},{"label":"get(std::variant)","note":"reads the value of the variant given the index or the type (if the type is unique), throws on error"}]}]},"standards":["C++17"],"wordCount":109,"codeBlockCount":2}
